37_228441655760335_3185286986295262213_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GBowz_NX4dMQ7kNvwEqpvJ_&_nc_oc=AdqYpoGSESMZ6svMRg07S--uePADChXAr-ugXUp-BfJMjuqZlOFfvnrSxh4N8jWInA4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5LH54_pOEzlTJ-CU6hIBcnOevWCgLfIsGa_jbM866BGA&oe=6A088EC2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Blackjack", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Play SUPER FAST real-time MULTIPLAYER Blackjack now to improve your skills, gain experience, make new FRIENDS.\n\nWith Blackjack, you now have the famous gambling game always with you - for free and online. Play Blackjack like a pro. Adapt the rules, train your skills and become a blackjack pro yourself!\n\n\u2666\ufe0f 10,000 FREE CHIPS ON SIGN-UP.\n\u2660\ufe0f 1000 FREE CHIPS EVERY 12 HOURS.\n\u2665\ufe0f VOICE CHAT \u2013 Live voice chat with gamers all over the world.\n\u2663\ufe0f AVATARS \u2013 To personalize your in-game look.\n\nBlackjack is a free online game of chance and skill for entertainment purposes only. It is not possible to win real money, real items/services/gifts or goods in kind by playing our skill games. The virtual currencies used in this game are called Chips, and they can be purchased in the \u2018Store\u2019 with real money. Chips cannot be exchanged for cash or be paid out in any form and can only be used to play our game. Blackjack is intended solely for an adult audience - gamers aged eighteen years or over.", "short_description": "Play SUPER FAST real-time MULTIPLAYER Blackjack now to improve your skills, gain experience, make new FRIENDS and become the best Blackjack player ever!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://intisab.net/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Intisab Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fb.com/BlackjackVR", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_categ